my message was:

Anyone see this error before?  Looks ominous to me:

Aug 25 12:09:21 pms507 vmunix: UBC write error(4) on device (0, 0) at block 848
size 8192
Aug 28 12:03:10 pms507 vmunix: UBC write error(4) on device (0, 0) at block 656
