    A: Yes - Mail to the FAQ maintainer and request the appropriate
        application notes.


    Q: Can I attach a DLT2000 to an IBM RS/6000 AIX 3.2 ?

    A: Yes - Mail to the FAQ maintainer and request the appropriate
        application notes.


